          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the benefits of using hydroxyapatite mouthwash?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>There are several benefits to using hydroxyapatite mouthwash, including: </p><ul><li><strong>Promoting a healthier oral microbiome:</strong> It supports a balanced oral microbiome. By fostering beneficial bacteria, it contributes to overall oral health and maintains fresher breath.</li><li><strong>Whitening teeth: </strong>It can help to remove surface stains from teeth, resulting in a whiter smile.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--15151992045611__a30cc0cc-1ccb-4a08-8255-b411b0719a27-collapsible_row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are these tablets fluoride-free?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! It is fluoride-free and is powered by hydroxyapatite and probiotics.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--15151992045611__a30cc0cc-1ccb-4a08-8255-b411b0719a27-collapsible_row-4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do Restore Mouthwash Tablets work?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Mouthwash tablets work through a simple process: Chew, Swish, Spit, and Smile. When chewed, these waterless tablets are activated by saliva, creating a refreshing, minty mouthwash. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "d879d6c4-b873-4838-b112-0dc9c6b661f7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How often should I use these mouthwash tablets?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>You can use these tablets daily, or as directed by your dentist, to maintain optimal oral hygiene. Follow the recommended usage instructions provided with the product for the best results.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "a2904877-d3b2-493e-ae47-e65218b7ac96": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are these tablets suitable for children?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>These tablets are designed for adult use. It is recommended to consult with a pediatric dentist before using these tablets for children.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
